  "description": "Behind his beautiful face, Wui-Jeong hides a vicious nature. Seeing how easily others misunderstand Hae-Jin because of his intimidating appearance, Wui-Jeong bullies and uses him throughout their youth. As adults, they meet again by chance. Hae-Jin tries to walk away, only to be trapped by Wui-Jeong’s cruelty into a night he never consented to.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes nine extra chapters.*",
